        "title": "Atelier Sophie 2: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Dream",
        "extract": "Atelier Sophie 2: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Dream is a 2022 Japanese role-playing video game developed by Gust.  It was released in February 2022 for Microsoft Windows (via Steam), Nintendo Switch, and PlayStation 4. It is the 23rd game in the Atelier series and the fourth game in its Mysterious subseries, while chronologically set between the events of Atelier Sophie: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Book and Atelier Firis: The Alchemist and the Mysterious Journey. It is also the second game of the series with a returning protagonist, after Atelier Ryza 2: Lost Legends & the Secret Fairy.",
