        "pageid": 72385563,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Atelier Ryza 3: Alchemist of the End & the Secret Key",
        "extract": "Atelier Ryza 3: Alchemist of the End & the Secret Key is a role-playing video game developed by Gust. It is the twenty-fourth main entry in the Atelier series, the third and final game of the Secret storyline, featuring the same protagonist from the two previous installments and celebrating the 25th anniversary of the franchise.\nThe game was released on 23 March 2023 in Japan for PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5 and Nintendo Switch, with an English subtitled version released on March 24, 2023 in Europe and North America alongside a Microsoft Windows version for all three regions.\nAn updated version of the game with additional playable characters and content, titled Atelier Ryza 3: Alchemist of the End & the Secret Key DX, was released on November 13, 2025 on the same platforms, also including Nintendo Switch 2 as part of the Atelier Ryza Secret Trilogy Deluxe Pack.",
